      "comment": "One reified statement about the world — a derived information object, never an event. core:describes names the subject entity, assertion:predicate names the relation IRI, the object is an entity or location (assertion:hasObject) or a literal (assertion:literalValue), core:validFrom/core:validUntil carry valid time, core:hasSource cites Documents, core:hasConfidence is optional.",
